* official Analog Canvas netlist; PDK X cards rewritten by convert.py
.model nch nmos
.model pch pmos

.subckt dut VDD VSS VB2 VREF VB1 VB3 IBUF VIN VOUT
CL VOUT net14 1p
M1 net7 net7 net10 VDD pch l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
